解题步骤如下:

\begin{array}{@{}1}
(3 - 6 - 7 + 3) + ((5 \times 5 \times 1 - -3))
\end{array}

首先计算括号内的部分:
\begin{array}{@{}1}
-2
\end{array}

然后计算整个表达式:
\begin{array}{*{}}
(3 - 6 - 7 + 3) + ((5 \times 5 \times 1 - -3))
\end{array}

将结果代入原问题, 得到答案:

-2 + (5 \times 5 \times 1 - -3)
= -2 + (5 \times 5 \times 1 - -3) = -2 + (5 \times 5 \times 1 - -3)

将结果代入原问题, 得到答案:

-2 + (5 \times 5 \times 1 - -3) = -2 + (5 \times 5 \times 1 - -3)
= -2 + (5 \times 5 \times 1 - -3) = -2 + (5 \times 5 \times 1 - -3)

答案: : -2.
